- a full-blown super- - Do not say the H-word.

82
00:06:51,820 --> 00:06:54,770
-杰西  -我已经够头疼了
- Jess... - I-I've got enough of a headache as it is.

83
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:57,010
我就是说  你该考虑回趟家
I'm just saying, you might wanna consider going home,

84
00:06:57,010 --> 00:06:59,630
睡会儿觉  然后再回归社会
getting some sleep, rejoining society.

85
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:00,660
我这不跟你说话呢嘛
I'm talking to you.

86
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:02,700
我很感激
And I appreciate that.

87
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:07,470
-这里面是有威士忌吗  -是啊  那杯是我的
- Is there whiskey in this? - Oh, yeah, that's mine.

88
00:07:37,470 --> 00:07:39,660
看来你鼓捣文件没白忙活
Looks like all of your paper-pushing worked.

89
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:44,520
给这位明星解开  把他带走
Uncuff the superstar. Get him out of my sight.

90
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,200
我不好
My bad.

91
00:07:58,990 --> 00:07:59,960
这是你的
