你们知道科尔在哪吗
You guys know where I can find Cole?

562
00:39:55,600 --> 00:39:56,550
关你什么事
What's it to you?

563
00:40:03,270 --> 00:40:04,060
再上一层
One floor up.

564
00:40:05,180 --> 00:40:05,980
谢谢
Thanks.

565
00:40:30,100 --> 00:40:32,150
我叫你们别再闹了
Man, I told y'all to stop playing!

566
00:40:34,070 --> 00:40:35,660
我是来表示悼念的
I'm here to pay my respects.

567
00:40:38,600 --> 00:40:39,480
凯奇
Cage.

568
00:40:40,490 --> 00:40:41,990
我知道你是谁
I know who you are.

569
00:40:46,810 --> 00:40:49,270
-你认识肖恩吗  -不
- Did you know Sean? - No.

570
00:40:50,680 --> 00:40:52,200
但我认识你姐姐坎迪斯
But I knew your sister Candace.

571
00:40:53,450 --> 00:40:55,570
我猜我也是来悼念她的
I guess I'm here to pay my respects for her, too.

572
00:40:55,660 --> 00:40:57,290
这家人运气真好  是吧
This family's got some luck, huh?

573
00:40:59,310 --> 00:41:02,900
在这里  坏事往往会发生在好人身上
Around here, bad things have a tendency to happen to good people.

574
00:41:04,760 --> 00:41:05,660
你觉得你哥哥的死
Do you think your brother's death

575
00:41:05,660 --> 00:41:07,070
会跟她的死有关吗
could somehow be related to hers?

576
00:41:07,070 --> 00:41:08,940
不  我觉得不...
No. I don't think...

577
00:41:11,260 --> 00:41:14,930
不  肖恩的事  更多是起意外
No, what happened to Sean was, um... was more like an accident.

578
00:41:15,870 --> 00:41:17,500
-你确定吗  -是的
- You sure about that? - Yeah.

579
00:41:20,890 --> 00:41:22,240
听说他找到份新工作
I heard he got a new job.

580
00:41:22,770 --> 00:41:24,250
那我可不知道
I ain't know nothing about that.

581
00:41:25,170 --> 00:41:29,530
我们不是无所不谈的  那是他的事
I mean, we didn't talk about everything. That was his business.

582
00:41:30,190 --> 00:41:31,010
当然了
Of course.

583
00:41:33,020 --> 00:41:33,920
你呢
What about you?

584
00:41:34,850 --> 00:41:35,520
什么
What?

585
00:41:38,060 --> 00:41:39,490
你情况似乎还不错
Things seem to be going okay.

586
00:41:41,740 --> 00:41:42,860
你也找到了新工作吗
Did you get a new gig?

587
00:41:44,910 --> 00:41:48,330
不  我现在还在找工作
No. I'm just in between stuff right now.

588
00:41:49,070 --> 00:41:51,120
我总在忙那个  懂吗
I'm always on that hustle, though. You feel me?

589
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:52,090
懂
I do.

590
00:41:54,970 --> 00:41:58,250
听着  我能帮你
Listen... I can help you.

591
