已经太迟了
It's too late for all of that.

597
00:42:13,410 --> 00:42:14,160
什么意思  太迟了
What do you mean, "It's too late"?

598
00:42:14,160 --> 00:42:15,910
-没事  -孩子  永远不太晚
- Nothing. - Son, it's never too late- -

599
00:42:15,910 --> 00:42:17,420
我才不是你的孩子
Yo, man, I ain't your son!

600
00:42:18,410 --> 00:42:20,520
我说了  我什么都不知道
I told you, I don't know a damn thing.

601
00:42:24,240 --> 00:42:27,100
不管你在做什么  你会让自己受伤的
Whatever you're doing, you're gonna get yourself hurt.

602
00:42:29,040 --> 00:42:30,170
想想你妈妈
Think about your mom.

603
00:42:32,380 --> 00:42:34,040
想想她已经遭遇的一切
What she's already been through.

604
00:42:43,870 --> 00:42:45,340
我觉得你该走了
I think you should go.

605
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:50,930
唯一能帮我的办法就是把我也变得刀枪不入
The only way to help me is to make me bulletproof, too.

606
00:42:54,330 --> 00:42:55,800
英雄已经来迟了
It's too late for heroes.

607
00:42:57,660 --> 00:43:00,010
英雄是你说的  不是我
Hero's your word. Not mine.

608
00:43:12,960 --> 00:43:16,290
-我要我的钱  -我知道  会给你的
- I want my money. - I hear you. I'm gonna get it.

609
00:43:16,290 --> 00:43:18,280
给你到今天晚上
You got till the end of the day,

610
00:43:18,280 --> 00:43:20,340
否则我会回来  砸点东西
or I'm coming back here to bust some shit up!

611
00:43:42,620 --> 00:43:44,920
约翰·雷蒙德  我是杰西卡·琼斯
John Raymond, it's Jessica Jones.

612
00:43:45,870 --> 00:43:48,760
我在回你的电话
I'm, uh... returning your call.

613
00:43:48,760 --> 00:43:51,100
你记得你企图吓我的那通电话吗
You remember the one where you tried to scare me?

614
00:43:56,090 --> 00:43:58,490
楼下的人说你在这里的
The guy downstairs said you were here.

615
00:43:59,390 --> 00:44:01,480
哥们  我不在乎你在做什么怪事
Dude, I don't care what weird shit you're into,

616
00:44:01,480 --> 00:44:02,730
我们得谈谈
but we gotta talk.

617
00:44:06,460 --> 00:44:08,620
好吧  你会付出代价的
All right, well, you're gonna pay for this.

618
00:44:46,990 --> 00:44:50,170
...模拟一个缓慢的欧元区经济体
...and help stimulate a slow Eurozone economy...

619
00:44:56,950 --> 00:44:58,900
{\an8}炸药

620
