老天爷
Holy shit.

621
00:45:12,780 --> 00:45:13,550
谢谢
Thank you.

622
00:45:24,340 --> 00:45:27,540
我们做了安排  如你所要求
We made arrangements, as you requested.

623
00:45:30,370 --> 00:45:32,200
你确定吗
Are you certain about this?

624
00:45:32,510 --> 00:45:34,670
还有时间考虑
There's still time to think it through.

625
00:45:35,870 --> 00:45:36,750
你走吧
You can go.

626
00:45:52,750 --> 00:45:55,540
-世界上最伟大的城市  -是啊
- Greatest city in the world. - Yeah.

627
00:45:56,450 --> 00:45:57,970
纽约人都喜欢那么说
New Yorkers like saying that.

628
00:46:00,130 --> 00:46:02,690
不过  经历了这一切
Still, after all this time, I...

629
00:46:04,690 --> 00:46:06,060
我不知道我对它是什么感觉
I don't know how I feel about it.

630
00:46:06,850 --> 00:46:10,380
这就是它的妙处  它可以成为你需要的任何样子
That's the beauty of it. It can be whatever you need it to be.

631
00:46:12,540 --> 00:46:14,100
你需要它是什么
What do you need it to be?

632
00:46:15,390 --> 00:46:16,110
家
Home.

633
00:47:15,300 --> 00:47:18,380
...周三中央银行保持利率不变
...Central Bank on Wednesday kept interest rates unchanged,

634
00:47:18,380 --> 00:47:21,280
顶住了加入其他大中央银行的压力
resisting pressure to join other major central banks...

635
00:47:28,590 --> 00:47:29,310
谢谢
Thanks.

636
00:48:21,790 --> 00:48:23,150
就是一座城市而已
It's just a city.

637
00:48:25,670 --> 00:48:27,810
你会习惯看着它们倒下的
You'll get used to watching them fall.

638
00:48:53,540 --> 00:48:55,400
我们得赶紧下去  走楼梯
We gotta get down right away. Take the stairs!

639
00:48:55,410 --> 00:48:56,800
快下楼
Get down the stairs!

640
00:49:12,630 --> 00:49:15,580
你拨打的号码...请查准号码再拨
...you have dialed. Please check the number and dial again.

